---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import StickyNav from '../components/StickyNav.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

import heroBg from '../assets/about/hero-background.png';
import faceOfMan from '../assets/about/face-of-man.png';
import myInspirations from '../assets/about/my-inspirations.png';
import myStory from '../assets/about/my-story.png';
import myPsychologists from '../assets/about/my-psychologists.png';
import flyingBird from '../assets/about/flying-bird-with-objects.png';
import startWithWhy from '../assets/about/start-with-why-book.png';
import wabisabiVase from '../assets/about/wabisabi-vase.png';
import flyingWhale from '../assets/about/flying-whale-divider.png';
import coffeeDesign from '../assets/about/coffee-and-design.png';
import humtaarImg from '../assets/about/humtaar.png';
import bharatbionImg from '../assets/about/bharatbion.png';
import meditationImg from '../assets/about/meditation.png';
import bookImg from '../assets/about/book.png';
import animeImg from '../assets/about/anime.png';
import friendsImg from '../assets/about/freinds.png';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Daksh Sharma"
  description="I think design is mostly storytelling. Senior Product Designer working where AI, health, and high-craft interfaces meet."
>
  <StickyNav />

  <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="abthero">
    <Image
      class="abthero__bg"
      src={heroBg}
      alt=""
      widths={[960, 1440, 1920, 2560]}
      sizes="100vw"
      format="webp"
      quality={80}
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />

    <header class="abthero__nav">
      <a class="abthero__brand" href="/" aria-label="Home">
        <Logo white />
      </a>
      <nav class="abthero__links" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/about" aria-current="page">About</a>
        <a href="/#work">Work</a>
        <a href="/#contact">Contact</a>
        <a class="abthero__resume" href="/Daksh_Sharma_Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Resume <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="abthero__center">
      <div class="abthero__face">
        <Image
          src={faceOfMan}
          alt="Daksh Sharma — Magritte-style portrait with an apple"
          widths={[200, 400]}
          sizes="8rem"
          format="webp"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
      <h1 class="abthero__title">I think design is mostly storytelling</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="abthero__scroll" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="abthero__chevron abthero__chevron--1" viewBox="0 0 24 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M2 2L12 10L22 2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
      <svg class="abthero__chevron abthero__chevron--2" viewBox="0 0 24 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M2 2L12 10L22 2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ MAIN CONTENT ═══ -->
  <article class="abt">

    <!-- ── Flashback ── -->
    <section class="abt__section">
      <h2 class="abt__heading">Let&rsquo;s start with a flashback</h2>

      <div class="abt__collage">
        <Image
          src={myInspirations}
          alt="A collage of animated characters, classical paintings, and surreal art that shaped how I think about storytelling"
          widths={[600, 1000, 1600]}
          sizes="min(52rem, 92vw)"
          format="webp"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="abt__prose">
        <p>The <strong>animated films</strong> I grew up on and the <strong>art</strong> that I saw taught me you can make someone feel something without saying it directly. I&rsquo;ve been trying to do that with products ever since. The goal was never just to make it work. It was to make someone feel something.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="abt__strip">
        <Image
          src={myStory}
          alt="Newspaper clipping of a young Daksh winning a design competition, building at a science fair, and the NIT Rourkela campus"
          widths={[600, 1200, 2000]}
          sizes="min(52rem, 92vw)"
          format="webp"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="abt__prose">
        <p>Long before I knew the word &ldquo;design,&rdquo; I was a kid who just made things: science fair models, robots, whatever the problem in front of me needed. That instinct took me through <strong>industrial design engineering at NIT Rourkela</strong>, and somewhere along the way I found the digital version of it. Same love of building, better tools, a lot more people to build for.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Psychology ── -->
    <section class="abt__section">
      <div class="abt__collage">
        <Image
          src={myPsychologists}
          alt="A collage of psychologists and thinkers — Freud, Jung, Kahneman — surrounded by floating brains"
          widths={[600, 1000, 1600]}
          sizes="min(52rem, 92vw)"
          format="webp"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="abt__prose">
        <p>What pulls me most is what happens beneath a decision. I found <strong>Carl Jung</strong> early, and the idea that so much of what moves us is unconscious, symbolic, half-hidden, felt like the truest thing anyone had said about people. It changed what I look for in a product. Not just whether it&rsquo;s usable, but what it makes someone feel before they&rsquo;ve thought about it at all. Most of the interesting work happens on that layer.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── More Daksh (highlighted with accent bar) ── -->
    <section class="abt__section abt__section--accent">
      <h2 class="abt__heading">How can I make it more Daksh?</h2>

      <div class="abt__collage">
        <Image
          src={flyingBird}
          alt="A surreal collage of objects that inspire me — a Magritte archway, Sony Walkman, Cesca chair, TP-7, and a Swatch watch, all tied together by a flying dove"
          widths={[600, 1000, 1600]}
          sizes="min(52rem, 92vw)"
          format="webp"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="abt__prose">
        <p>I&rsquo;ve always loved the <strong>products brave enough to be strange</strong>: the ones that could have been a beige box and chose to be joyful instead. &ldquo;How can I make it more Daksh?&rdquo; is the permission I give myself to do the same. Get it correct first, then push past correct into something that looks a little different and connects. That last ten percent is usually the only part anyone remembers.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ── Principles ── -->
      <div class="abt__principles">
        <div class="principle">
          <div class="principle__arch"></div>
          <div class="principle__img">
            <Image
              src={startWithWhy}
              alt="Start With Why by Simon Sinek"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="principle__text"><strong>Start with why</strong> &mdash; before anything else, I ask what the work is really for</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <div class="principle__arch"></div>
          <div class="principle__img">
            <Image
              src={wabisabiVase}
              alt="A kintsugi vase repaired with gold — wabi-sabi, the beauty of imperfection"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="principle__text"><strong>Perfect imperfection</strong> &mdash; nothing is right on day one, so I ship, watch, and let the data say where to go next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Whale divider (full-width) ── -->
    <div class="abt__divider">
      <Image
        src={flyingWhale}
        alt=""
        widths={[600, 1200, 2000]}
        sizes="100vw"
        format="webp"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Side quests ── -->
    <section class="abt__section">
      <h2 class="abt__heading">My side quests</h2>
      <p class="abt__intro">My paid work has been mostly health tech, most recently as the only designer on a metabolic health platform. The things I&rsquo;m proudest of, though, are the ones nobody asked me to build.</p>

      <ul class="sidequests">
        <li class="sidequest">
          <div class="sidequest__img">
            <Image
              src={coffeeDesign}
              alt="Two students huddled around a laptop at a college corridor, working on a product design project"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="sidequest__body">
            <h3 class="sidequest__name">Coffee &amp; Design</h3>
            <p class="sidequest__desc">A place to teach product design to engineering students who&rsquo;d been told it was the lesser path. Four people then, a community now &mdash; and proof that health wasn&rsquo;t going away.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="sidequest">
          <div class="sidequest__img">
            <Image
              src={bharatbionImg}
              alt="BharatBion — AI-assisted ultrasound analysis platform"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="sidequest__body">
            <h3 class="sidequest__name">BharatBion</h3>
            <p class="sidequest__desc">An AI-assisted diagnostic platform that helps sonologists catch what they might miss. Designed the clinical workflow and reporting interface from scratch.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="sidequest">
          <div class="sidequest__img">
            <Image
              src={humtaarImg}
              alt="Humtaar — You're not broken, you're just stuck"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="sidequest__body">
            <h3 class="sidequest__name">Humtaar</h3>
            <p class="sidequest__desc">Built on a simple belief: most people aren&rsquo;t broken, just stuck. It won&rsquo;t replace a therapist, but getting someone to talk out loud might still be worth building.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Off the clock ── -->
    <section class="abt__section">
      <h2 class="abt__heading">When I&rsquo;m not working, I&rsquo;m usually somewhere off the clock.</h2>

      <ul class="offclock">
        <li class="offclock__item">
          <div class="offclock__img">
            <Image
              src={meditationImg}
              alt="Daksh sitting cross-legged on a forest road, meditating"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="offclock__body">
            <h3 class="offclock__name">Stillness</h3>
            <p class="offclock__desc">Where I actually process things. Most of what I manage to notice, I notice from here.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="offclock__item">
          <div class="offclock__img">
            <Image
              src={bookImg}
              alt="Daksh browsing a bookshelf"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="offclock__body">
            <h3 class="offclock__name">Books</h3>
            <p class="offclock__desc">I read to borrow other people&rsquo;s thinking. They&rsquo;ve usually already chewed on whatever I&rsquo;m stuck on.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="offclock__item">
          <div class="offclock__img">
            <Image
              src={animeImg}
              alt="Roronoa Zoro wanted poster"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="offclock__body">
            <h3 class="offclock__name">Anime</h3>
            <p class="offclock__desc">My comfort medium and, honestly, still the clearest proof of what storytelling can do to a person.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="offclock__item">
          <div class="offclock__img">
            <Image
              src={friendsImg}
              alt="A group of friends in the snow"
              widths={[300, 500]}
              sizes="12rem"
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="offclock__body">
            <h3 class="offclock__name">Friends</h3>
            <p class="offclock__desc">The people who keep me out of my own head and remind me the work isn&rsquo;t the whole point.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>

  <div class="grid-bg">
    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  body:has(.abt) {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>

<style>
  /* ═══ HERO ═══ */
  .abthero {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .abthero__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center bottom;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .abthero__nav {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
  }

  .abthero__brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .abthero__links {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: var(--font-md);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .abthero__links a {
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .abthero__links a::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: #fff;
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .abthero__links a:hover::after,
  .abthero__links a:focus-visible::after {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }

  .abthero__links a[aria-current="page"]::after {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }

  .abthero__resume {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--accent) !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .abthero__resume::after {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .abthero__resume:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .abthero__resume span {
    margin-left: 0.15em;
    font-size: 1.1em;
  }

  .abthero__center {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding: 8rem var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .abthero__scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .abthero__chevron {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 1rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: scrollBounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .abthero__chevron--1 {
    animation-delay: 0s;
  }

  .abthero__chevron--2 {
    animation-delay: 0.15s;
    margin-top: -0.2rem;
  }

  @keyframes scrollBounce {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
    40%  { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    80%  { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
    100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
  }

  .abthero__face {
    width: 9rem;
    height: 9rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .abthero__face :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .abthero__title {
    max-width: 52rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ═══ ARTICLE ═══ */
  .abt {
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem var(--space-xl) 8rem;
  }

  .abt__section {
    margin-top: 7rem;
  }

  .abt__section:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .abt__heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .abt__heading--lg {
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .abt__intro {
    font-size: var(--font-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .abt__collage,
  .abt__strip,
  .abt__prose {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .abt__heading + .abt__collage,
  .abt__heading + .abt__prose,
  .abt__heading + .abt__strip {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .abt__collage :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .abt__strip :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .abt__prose p {
    font-size: var(--font-md);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .abt__prose strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ═══ ACCENT SECTION (orange bar) ═══ */
  .abt__section--accent {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: var(--space-xl);
  }

  /* ═══ PRINCIPLES ═══ */
  .abt__principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .principle {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 4rem;
  }

  .principle__arch {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: #FDF6F0;
    border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0 / 30% 30% 0 0;
  }

  .principle__img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 55%;
    max-width: 12rem;
  }

  .principle__img :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .principle__text {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-size: var(--font-md);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 0 var(--space-xl) var(--space-xl);
  }

  .principle__text strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ═══ WHALE DIVIDER (full-width) ═══ */
  .abt__divider {
    width: 100vw;
    margin-left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    margin-top: 5rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .abt__divider :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* ═══ SIDE QUESTS ═══ */
  .sidequests {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sidequest {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 14rem 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .sidequest:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sidequest__img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .sidequest__img::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 100%;
    width: 0;
    height: 4rem;
    border-left: 2px dashed #ccc;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .sidequest:last-child .sidequest__img::after {
    display: none;
  }

  .sidequest__img :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .sidequest__body {
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .sidequest__name {
    font-size: var(--font-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .sidequest__desc {
    font-size: var(--font-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ═══ OFF THE CLOCK ═══ */
  .offclock {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .offclock::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    border-left: 2px dashed var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .offclock::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 50%;
    border-top: 2px dashed var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .offclock__item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  .offclock__img {
    width: 10rem;
    height: 10rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .offclock__img :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .offclock__name {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: var(--font-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(231, 95, 56, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(231, 95, 56, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 0.25rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .offclock__desc {
    font-size: var(--font-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ═══ RESPONSIVE ═══ */
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .abthero {
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .abthero__nav {
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    }
    .abthero__links {
      gap: var(--space-md);
      font-size: var(--font-sm);
    }
    .abthero__title {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 7vw, 2.5rem);
      padding: 0 var(--space-md);
    }
    .abthero__face {
      width: 6.5rem;
      height: 6.5rem;
    }
    .abt {
      padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-md) var(--space-2xl);
    }
    .abt__section--accent {
      padding-left: var(--space-md);
    }
